    restart+ on the right foot
        : see @ ../02.wrong_rhetoric/wrong_rhetoric.README.brec
        - let the argument (bare and unencumbered) speak for itself
            : see @ ../02.wrong_rhetoric/wrong_rhetoric.README.brec
            - so I did
                : see `^━+  B o t c h e d .+ 2  ━` @ text.brec
            - already it pleads for rhetoric, as described below
                / albeit only a shred, what a single leading sentence might deliver
        + orient the reader from the outset
            tether+ to the (abtruse) mystery of the safehold’s presence a larger (more pressing) mystery
            - viz. that of morality, or the (popular but derided) ‘meaning of life’, or both together
                ?+ ad ‘both’, who conjoins them, and how?
        + sieze the reader’s attention
            promise+ a solution to the former that solves also the latter
